// File:    std/generic_monomorph_test.skink
// Purpose: Regression tests for AST-level monomorphization of generic
//          structs, functions, and methods. Under the old type-erasure
//          scheme every type parameter lowered to i8*, which broke any
//          instantiation storing real values (non-pointer-sized fields,
//          []T composites, integer keys). These cases previously lived
//          as compilefail fixtures (cf_generic_struct_erasure*) — they
//          now compile and run correctly.
